#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:117
msgid ""
"When you press Play in DuckStation or PCSX2, RetroDB writes your sign-in "
"to that emulator's own settings file. A sign-in you made in the "
"emulator's own menu is left alone."
msgstr ""
"כשלוחצים על הפעלה ב-DuckStation או ב-PCSX2, ‏RetroDB כותב את ההתחברות "
